{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は宮城公演1日目ですね！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう宮城着いたよって方もいらっしゃるかな？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだだよって方も焦らずいらしてくださいね☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しもうね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "‪𓂃 𓈒𓏸◌‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "千葉公演2日目ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesに、千葉の皆さんに、櫻坂のパワーが届いて、少しでも力になれていたらと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分たちに出来ることは、全力で櫻坂の活動を全うすることしかなく、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "千葉の皆さんが大変な時に、なかなか自分たちにできることがない中、このタイミングでライブを開催させていただけてとてもありがたかったです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも、誰かにとって、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分たちの活動が心の支えや救いになれるような存在でありたいです。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobwurlIj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobBwouk8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob8UyAbF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobYkMbGs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobTdwI2Z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobECn4Ti.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "‪𓂃 𓈒𓏸◌‬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢MUSIC AWARDS JAPAN 2026｣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リクエスト特別賞"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『推し活リクエスト・アーティスト・オブ・ザ・イヤー powered by USEN』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46が受賞し、THE RUBYをいただきました！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobGb7BZn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesのみんな！！本当にありがとうございます！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にびっくりだった！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すっっごく嬉しかったです！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobI09f2n.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#MAJ2026"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#MUSICAWARDSJAPAN"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログお読みいただきありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobMMZtgw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね🌺🌴"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "里奈"}], "source": "official"}